<title>UK: Sweden adds 200 mln Danish crowns to Dec 2004 bond.</title>
<headline>Sweden adds 200 mln Danish crowns to Dec 2004 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 600 million Danish crowns from 400 million crowns, lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWEDEN</p>
<p> AMT    600 MLN DKR   COUPON     4.0	 MATURITY    15.DEC.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    17.FEB.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/AA+   FULL FEES  **</p>
<p> NOTES   ** UNDISCLOSED</p>
<p>		ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED ON 20.JAN.97</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
